    <string name="appearance_title">Appearance</string>
    <string name="appearance_subtitle">ARCHITECTURAL FORGE · VISUAL CALIBRATION CHAMBER</string>
    <string name="appearance_quality_card">Visual quality (Monumental core)</string>
    <string name="appearance_quality_low">LOW: static or nearly static core, no glow, effect cadence 5–15 fps. Intended for thermal pressure and reduced motion.</string>
    <string name="appearance_quality_balanced">BALANCED (default): 30 fps complex animation target, moderate particles, layered assets, limited glow.</string>
    <string name="appearance_quality_high">HIGH: richer particles and more ring layers. Only after physical-device qualification; falls back automatically under pressure.</string>
    <string name="appearance_thermal_policy">Thermal policy uses real device temperature reads; TARGET_PENDING_DEVICE_QUALIFICATION until Xiaomi measurements exist.</string>
    <string name="appearance_theme">Theme</string>
    <string name="appearance_theme_note">Obsidian Night is the default identity (decision D-009) and the base of the Monumental Oracle Tower identity: lowest power draw, lowest burn-in stress and correct night ambience for an always-on AMOLED console. Marble Light is the daylight / inspection theme.</string>
