    <string name="mm_bundled_explainer">Four physically verified ONNX artifacts (openWakeWord trio + GTCRN denoiser) ride inside the APK and are delivered into the model storage roots through the same hash-gated, receipted pipeline as network downloads. No network is used — provenance ‘app-bundle’. Delivery does NOT enable behavior: the wake word stays OFF until the FA/FR harness on the Xiaomi and the denoiser stays bypassed until device qualification.</string>
